{"words": [{"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "And those who"}, {"text": "يُتَوَفَّوْنَ", "translation": "pass away"}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "وَيَذَرُونَ", "translation": "and leave behind"}, {"text": "أَزْوَٰجًۭا", "translation": "wives"}, {"text": "يَتَرَبَّصْنَ", "translation": "(the widows) should wait"}, {"text": "بِأَنفُسِهِنَّ", "translation": "for themselves"}, {"text": "أَرْبَعَةَ", "translation": "(for) four"}, {"text": "أَشْهُرٍۢ", "translation": "months"}, {"text": "وَعَشْرًۭا ۖ", "translation": "and ten (days)"}, {"text": "فَإِذَا", "translation": "Then when"}, {"text": "بَلَغْنَ", "translation": "they reach"}, {"text": "أَجَلَهُنَّ", "translation": "their (specified) term"}, {"text": "فَلَا", "translation": "then (there is) no"}, {"text": "جُنَاحَ", "translation": "blame"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "upon you"}, {"text": "فِيمَا", "translation": "for what"}, {"text": "فَعَلْنَ", "translation": "they do"}, {"text": "فِىٓ", "translation": "concerning"}, {"text": "أَنفُسِهِنَّ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۗ", "translation": "in a fair manner"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "you do"}, {"text": "خَبِيرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) All-Aware"}], "sahih": "And those who are taken in death among you and leave wives behind - they, [the wives, shall] wait four months and ten [days]. And when they have fulfilled their term, then there is no blame upon you for what they do with themselves in an acceptable manner.1 And Allāh is [fully] Aware of what you do."}